{"asset_key":"ep1/quest_story_11101130","episode":"ep1","category":"quest_story","story_id":"11101130","schema_version":1,"lang":"kr","texts":{"say:0:1110113001:0":{"text":"이 길은 좀 멀지만, 사냥터를 지나가는 길이라 오늘 저녁밥은 해결된 거나 마찬가지야!","source_cn":"这条路有点远，不过好处是经过猎区，今天的晚饭又有着落咯！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xECB432676061C28B","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:1:1110113002:0":{"text":"여러분의 부족은 부족원 전체가 사냥을 나가나요?","source_cn":"你们氏族里，大家都要出门打猎吗？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x803224A83DC7B6EB","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:2:1110113003:0":{"text":"다른 트라이브들은 아직 어려서, 나랑 소렌만 사냥을 나가곤 해. 하지만 열매를 따거나, 땔감을 줍거나, 식사를 준비하는 일은... 모두 다 잘해.","source_cn":"主要是我跟索恩出门，其他的蛮血还小。但采摘，捡柴，做饭...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x24428ADA15D02AD9","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speaker:阿尔萨":{"text":"아르사","source":"阿尔萨","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:漫漫":{"text":"해미","source":"漫漫","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"}},"stats":{"flow_row_count":4,"localized_text_count":3,"speaker_count":2}}